Canonical website:
  https://github.com/libyal/libfsapfs

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/libyal/libfsapfs/archive/refs/tags/20261030.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack libfsapfs-20261030-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./libfsapfs-20261030-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/libfsapfs-20261030-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libfsapfs-20261030-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libfsapfs1-20261030-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libfsapfs-devel-20261030-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/python312-libfsapfs-20261030-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(libfsapfs)
  /usr/bin/fsapfsinfo.exe
  /usr/bin/fsapfsmount.exe
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/libfsapfs.README
  /usr/share/doc/libfsapfs/AUTHORS
  /usr/share/doc/libfsapfs/COPYING
  /usr/share/doc/libfsapfs/COPYING.LESSER
  /usr/share/doc/libfsapfs/ChangeLog
  /usr/share/doc/libfsapfs/README
  /usr/share/man/man1/fsapfsinfo.1.gz
  /usr/share/man/man1/fsapfsmount.1.gz

(libfsapfs1)
  /usr/bin/cygfsapfs-1.dll

(libfsapfs-devel)
  /usr/include/libfsapfs.h
  /usr/include/libfsapfs/codepage.h
  /usr/include/libfsapfs/definitions.h
  /usr/include/libfsapfs/error.h
  /usr/include/libfsapfs/extern.h
  /usr/include/libfsapfs/features.h
  /usr/include/libfsapfs/types.h
  /usr/lib/libfsapfs.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/libfsapfs.pc
  /usr/share/man/man3/libfsapfs.3.gz

(python312-libfsapfs)
  /usr/lib/python3.12/site-packages/pyfsapfs.cpython-312-x86_64-cygwin.dll

